     On success, these functions return the size in bytes of the location ex‐
     pression byte stream generated.  In case of an error, these functions re‐
     turn DW_DLV_NOCOUNT and set the argument _e_r_r.

EERRRROORRSS
     These functions can fail with:

     [DW_DLE_ARGUMENT]  Argument _e_x_p_r was NULL.

     [DW_DLE_MEMORY]    An out of memory condition was encountered during the
                        execution of the function.

